controlled by the Government;
(8)
"Infrastructure" includes public works relating to infrastructure for utilizing the natural resources and/or providing services
by either public works of physical structure or systems or facilities or commodities or utilization of resources or provision
of services;

5.
Composition of the Board.
- The Andhra Pradesh Economic Development Board shall consist of the following members :-
(a)
